  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Streamlining Global Blue Carbon Ambition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project Streamlining Global Blue Carbon Ambition aims to streamline and accelerate mitigation and adaptation activities related to blue carbon ecosystems, including via sustained investment in marine and coastal Nature-based Solutions, further contributing to the protection of biodiversity and increased resilience to climate change. The project activities will be conducted under the umbrella of the International Partnership for Blue Carbon (IPBC), co-coordinated by IOC-UNESCO, and will contribute to establishing a high-level ambition group within the IPBC and to providing guidance for high-quality investments in blue carbon protection and restoration activities.</narrative>
  </description>
